WEBVTT

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling, open up your eyes!

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling me wo akete

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
It is in this world's evil den

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
Kono yo no aku no soukutsu de

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
You shall receive a rare heart

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
Tsuibamareru kokoro hoshikute

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Escaping is impossible

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Nige mo dekinu

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
My imprisoned, pale-faced prince

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
Yuuhei no souhaku no ouji yo

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
I am a goddess

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
Watashi ga megami

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Kami-chama Karin

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Mini-Goddess Karin

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
In this ward, you have to poach everything

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
Subete wa mitsuryouku

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
With a hidden snare

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
Usumoreta wana ni

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
If you entrap them

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
Hamerareru no nara

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
You'll want to destroy them too…

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
Konagona ni kudaite hoshii wa

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
To die from natural causes or imcompetence

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
Shi ni itaranu yamai

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
It's all poison to your heart

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
Shinzou ni ha pawazon

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
A rose melting in the flames of purgatory

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
Rengoku no homura de zero kara

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Let's redeem this world…

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Saisei shimashou

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
A black dahlia in the nightless city's sky

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
Fuyoru no sora de kuroi daria

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
A lost delusion, a falling reality

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
Shisuru mousou ochiru genjitsu

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Struggling in hell like an ant

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Mogake ari jigoku

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling, give me your voice!

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling koe agete

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
For right now, our limits will have to change

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
Kono ima sashichigaeru hodo

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
If we want for the most important thing

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
Daiji na mono ga hoshii no nara

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Discover the result of your prayers

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Inori wa hatete

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Your princess is dying in prison

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Rougoku de shouten no himegimi

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
You are such a devil…

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
Anata ga maou

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Hate's fist and grief's wounds, too

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Ikari no ken mo nageki no kizu mo

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Dissolving, vanishing, unraveling, passing away, without a trace

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Atokata mo naku tokete kiete chitte utakata

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:35.500
The Theatre of Passionate Love waits for No One

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:52.950
Sooo-ry…

00:01:52.950 --> 00:01:59.720
I slept in and didn't make breakfast…

00:01:59.720 --> 00:02:05.030
That's fine, that's fine. I left fast so I just ate leftovers.

00:02:05.530 --> 00:02:11.940
Kazune-chan also left really early…

00:02:13.740 --> 00:02:19.440
Kazune-chan wasn't in the classroom.

00:02:19.440 --> 00:02:22.280
Where did he go?

00:02:27.970 --> 00:02:31.430
Karin… I…

00:02:34.430 --> 00:02:36.830
Kazune-kun, what's wrong?

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:42.440
Oh, sorry, sorry, keep this a secret, okay?

00:02:42.440 --> 00:02:46.300
My bad, my bad, let's do our best tomorrow.

00:02:48.910 --> 00:02:50.470
Kazune-chan?

00:02:52.180 --> 00:02:55.480
Kujyou-kun!!! Wonderful!!!

00:02:55.780 --> 00:02:56.460
Huh?

00:02:57.870 --> 00:02:58.920
Himeka.

00:03:00.070 --> 00:03:04.090
What's wrong? Your hair…

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:09.790
I felt it was missing something. So I dyed it… how does it look?

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:13.970
It really suits you.

00:03:15.870 --> 00:03:18.140
I'm falling for him more and more…

00:03:18.140 --> 00:03:20.870
It looks so amazing on you!

00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:23.870
The man of my dreams!

00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:25.480
Kazune-kun?

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:34.750
Michiru-sama, you look so wonderful!

00:03:35.050 --> 00:03:38.460
Sup', my little brother, I won't lose today.

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:48.600
Professor…

00:03:51.640 --> 00:03:53.140
Professor Kujyou…

00:03:57.840 --> 00:04:02.610
Kujyou-kun and Michiru-sama are…

00:04:06.580 --> 00:04:09.920
I can't look Kazune-kun in the face…

00:04:14.660 --> 00:04:21.340
No, no! Kazune-kun just does whatever he wants sometimes…

00:04:21.340 --> 00:04:24.340
I shouldn't worry about it.

00:04:25.460 --> 00:04:27.670
It's obvious it didn't mean anything.

00:04:34.350 --> 00:04:39.420
No, no! I can't think about these things, the play is going to start soon!

00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:41.520
Don't lose, Karin!

00:04:41.520 --> 00:04:42.950
Forth!

00:04:49.670 --> 00:04:55.700
My stomach suddenly hurts… Could it be the leftovers I ate?

00:05:00.910 --> 00:05:05.680
Why did you eat the leftover sashimi without asking?

00:05:07.210 --> 00:05:11.980
It's gone bad, I was thinking about throwing it out…

00:05:11.980 --> 00:05:13.620
I didn't eat it.

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:16.050
It'll give you a terrible stomach-ache.

00:05:16.050 --> 00:05:17.560
Like I was telling you, I didn't eat-

00:05:17.560 --> 00:05:21.030
Now let's get you some medical treatment.

00:05:21.030 --> 00:05:24.430
Nyaooo! I didn't eat it!

00:05:24.430 --> 00:05:26.810
I don't want medical treatment!

00:05:26.810 --> 00:05:29.530
I-I-It hurts…

00:05:30.200 --> 00:05:40.410
Next up! Sakuragaoka's seventh grade, Class A, presents: "Miyon's Theatre of Passionate Love".

00:05:40.410 --> 00:05:44.680
Himeka, do you need to go to the bathroom? Are you thirsty?

00:05:44.680 --> 00:05:45.670
No, I'm fine.

00:05:51.760 --> 00:05:54.430
Sorry about earlier.

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:57.460
You were just making a weird mistake, weren't you?

00:05:59.720 --> 00:06:01.500
By the way…

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:03.830
You still can't tell me?

00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:07.440
What you were saying about the ring the other day.

00:06:07.940 --> 00:06:12.340
…an effect from Kirika's strange ring.

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:15.750
Can you finish what you were telling me?

00:06:21.490 --> 00:06:29.030
I don't know exactly… but I know your ring holds a lot of power.

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:37.070
But why did Karasuma have that weird ring anyway?

00:06:38.070 --> 00:06:44.780
In the end, your ring's reaction to Karasuma's weird ring could have something to do with it.

00:06:48.850 --> 00:06:55.420
The fact that your ring reacted means that it's real after all.

00:06:58.260 --> 00:06:59.360
Take care of it.

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:04.430
Especially today, the Karasuma's have come to watch the play.

00:07:04.430 --> 00:07:05.300
Understand?

00:07:14.340 --> 00:07:18.980
I might not be able to give him anymore information.

00:07:27.890 --> 00:07:29.690
Karasuma's here.

00:07:40.800 --> 00:07:42.130
What's wrong, Karin?

00:07:42.130 --> 00:07:43.870
Karin-chan…

00:07:43.870 --> 00:07:45.200
Are you alright?

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:48.410
Hanazono-san!

00:07:48.620 --> 00:07:50.410
I found her collapsed in the hallway!

00:07:51.910 --> 00:07:53.740
Does your stomach hurt?

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:57.410
K… Kazune-kun…

00:07:57.410 --> 00:08:02.990
What should we do? We don't have anyone to play Princess Poisoned Apple.

00:08:02.990 --> 00:08:04.720
That means the play…

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:06.890
No way…

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:10.630
I'm fine! I can still do it!

00:08:10.630 --> 00:08:12.130
Karin…

00:08:15.670 --> 00:08:16.670
Karin-chan!

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:19.870
You moron. Stop pushing it.

00:08:20.780 --> 00:08:22.030
Why now?

00:08:22.200 --> 00:08:25.780
Hanazono-san, I understand how you feel…

00:08:25.780 --> 00:08:29.660
Does anyone else have her lines memorized?

00:08:31.450 --> 00:08:32.350
Kazune-kun…

00:08:32.350 --> 00:08:34.420
I'll go check!

00:08:34.890 --> 00:08:36.290
W-Wait!

00:08:36.290 --> 00:08:37.790
It can't be helped.

00:08:39.420 --> 00:08:42.460
No way… This can't be happening.

00:08:44.060 --> 00:08:47.970
I can't do it even after I worked so hard?

00:08:50.140 --> 00:08:52.810
I can't do it… why?

00:08:53.700 --> 00:08:57.340
Does it bother you?.. When you can't do what you want to do?

00:08:57.780 --> 00:09:00.140
Of course it does!

00:09:02.410 --> 00:09:05.780
So bad… I wanna do the play so bad!

00:09:12.460 --> 00:09:15.430
Fine! I guess this means you win!

00:09:15.430 --> 00:09:18.170
You must be so happy!

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:25.240
Come when you're better. I'll be waiting for you.

00:09:26.340 --> 00:09:28.370
Kazune-kun…

00:09:28.970 --> 00:09:34.280
Karin-chan, I'll be waiting too.

00:09:35.350 --> 00:09:36.580
Himeka-chan…

00:09:38.850 --> 00:09:40.080
Micchi…

00:09:46.790 --> 00:09:50.790
What's wrong Himeka? You don't look so good either.

00:09:51.560 --> 00:09:56.300
It's nothing.

00:09:56.300 --> 00:09:57.330
I see.

00:10:08.180 --> 00:10:12.280
Nii-san, what's wrong? You've been unsettled since earlier…

00:10:12.560 --> 00:10:14.690
No, it's nothing.

00:10:16.320 --> 00:10:20.360
What's this unsettling feeling in my chest?

00:10:22.750 --> 00:10:23.740
Is it grilled
eel over rice?

00:10:24.820 --> 00:10:27.280
I am God!

00:10:30.990 --> 00:10:32.240
You moron.

00:10:31.220 --> 00:10:32.240
It's a croquette!

00:10:33.310 --> 00:10:35.970
Can it be that my mirror speaks the truth?

00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:42.380
My younger brother's beauty. Does it really surpass my own?

00:10:42.380 --> 00:10:46.180
Hey, isn't that boy really hot?

00:10:46.180 --> 00:10:48.420
Totally, he's so pretty!

00:10:49.150 --> 00:10:50.090
Brother…

00:10:50.300 --> 00:10:52.430
What's this?! What's this?!

00:10:52.430 --> 00:10:54.530
Another hottie appeared!

00:10:55.090 --> 00:10:59.230
I wonder why elder brother avoids me so.

00:11:05.100 --> 00:11:08.870
Karin-chan! Weren't you resting in the infirmary?

00:11:09.690 --> 00:11:15.450
I was so worried I couldn't sleep. I think the medicine is working. I'm feeling much better.

00:11:19.750 --> 00:11:22.050
I'll be waiting for you.

00:11:25.720 --> 00:11:29.560
Well, I'm off to the mountain!

00:11:30.030 --> 00:11:34.160
Then I shall go to the river to do laundry!

00:11:34.850 --> 00:11:35.890
It's no good.

00:11:35.930 --> 00:11:40.060
It's like being back with the professor… I can't calm down.

00:11:42.400 --> 00:11:46.710
Even though I should know that it's not the professor…

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:56.550
Hey, who did you give the role of Princess Poisoned Apple to?

00:11:56.950 --> 00:11:58.660
A-About that…

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:03.160
Oh! Something is coming out of the apple!

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:09.370
I am Princess Poisoned Apple! A princess born from a poisoned apple!

00:12:10.270 --> 00:12:12.230
Prin… cess…

00:12:12.440 --> 00:12:15.670
Wow! What a wonderful prince!

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:18.430
What is that?!

00:12:18.430 --> 00:12:20.440
Calm down, Karin-chan!

00:12:20.440 --> 00:12:23.280
He's a peasant, not a princess!

00:12:23.280 --> 00:12:26.200
He's playing the princess like a star-struck country girl…

00:12:26.200 --> 00:12:30.390
He's the only one who had the Princess Poisoned Apple's lines memorized…

00:12:30.390 --> 00:12:34.860
Hmm… Has the amateur goddess gotten manlier as of late?

00:12:35.030 --> 00:12:37.490
Don't be silly, nii-san.

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:40.300
Is this love?

00:12:40.500 --> 00:12:42.430
Is this fate?

00:12:42.430 --> 00:12:44.170
La-la-la...

00:12:44.170 --> 00:12:45.590
Yes, together.

00:12:49.370 --> 00:12:52.290
Stay near Himeka.

00:12:53.210 --> 00:12:54.010
Nii-san.

00:12:55.860 --> 00:12:59.380
I'm switching with Yuki-kun when he comes backstage.

00:13:00.120 --> 00:13:01.650
Oh, you feeling better?

00:13:02.020 --> 00:13:02.840
A little.

00:13:02.990 --> 00:13:04.250
Have you seen Himeka?

00:13:04.590 --> 00:13:05.320
Himeka-chan?

00:13:05.620 --> 00:13:08.760
She's supposed to go on soon. I haven't seen her since earlier.

00:13:22.140 --> 00:13:23.410
Maybe she went to the bathroom.

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:24.610
I'll go look.

00:13:30.170 --> 00:13:31.880
Western glasses guy!

00:13:31.880 --> 00:13:36.430
Silence. I'm not "western glasses guy". I'm Karasuma Kirio.

00:13:36.430 --> 00:13:37.550
What do you want?

00:13:37.930 --> 00:13:41.350
Only cast and crew are allowed back here!

00:13:44.060 --> 00:13:45.000
Kazune-kun!

00:13:48.230 --> 00:13:49.170
Karasuma!

00:13:49.170 --> 00:13:54.320
- Kyaa~, prince! Whatever is wrong? Prince!

00:13:52.320 --> 00:13:52.770
- Karasuma!

00:13:58.880 --> 00:14:00.880
Nii-san, you transformed!

00:14:03.950 --> 00:14:06.720
I see. He's after Nishikiyori's ring.

00:14:06.720 --> 00:14:07.550
Micchi?

00:14:08.040 --> 00:14:15.030
No one can see Karasuma right now. I have to do something!

00:14:16.090 --> 00:14:17.890
D-Don't, Kazune-kun!

00:14:17.890 --> 00:14:21.010
I can handle one more time.

00:14:21.010 --> 00:14:21.800
Stop!

00:14:22.100 --> 00:14:24.180
Ego sumo deus!

00:14:27.600 --> 00:14:28.330
Wait!

00:14:29.190 --> 00:14:30.240
Karasuma!

00:14:30.240 --> 00:14:32.880
Don't interfere, Sun God!

00:14:32.880 --> 00:14:35.650
I have to stop them. I am Go-

00:14:35.650 --> 00:14:36.410
Ah?

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:40.020
Huh? My ring's gone!

00:14:41.780 --> 00:14:46.420
O-ho! I'm a prisoner of your love!

00:14:49.790 --> 00:14:51.660
This is a disaster.

00:14:51.830 --> 00:14:55.570
Kazune-chan, no…

00:14:55.970 --> 00:14:57.170
Himeka-chan!

00:14:58.470 --> 00:15:01.310
Don't transform…

00:15:01.770 --> 00:15:03.810
Himeka-chan, what's wrong?

00:15:04.210 --> 00:15:12.550
Karin-chan, please… stop Kazune-chan…

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:14.180
Himeka-chan!

00:15:15.030 --> 00:15:30.270
I'm fine… You're the only one who can… stop Kazune-chan… Karin-chan… please…

00:15:38.910 --> 00:15:41.350
Sun God! Who is that?

00:15:41.350 --> 00:15:42.610
Who?

00:15:42.610 --> 00:15:44.430
Nishikiyori Michiru!

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:45.850
Nishikiyori?

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:49.390
I could sense it even before the play began.

00:15:49.390 --> 00:15:52.860
It's still small,…

00:15:52.860 --> 00:15:56.230
but what a frightening power…

00:15:57.610 --> 00:15:59.610
The power that's leaking out of Nishikiyori…

00:15:59.610 --> 00:16:00.460
What?

00:16:00.460 --> 00:16:01.950
Just who is he?!

00:16:07.600 --> 00:16:10.910
Please stop! Don't fight anymore than this!

00:16:14.840 --> 00:16:16.750
Karin! What are you doing?

00:16:19.420 --> 00:16:23.420
I can do this. The lines are little different, but I know them!

00:16:25.820 --> 00:16:27.620
Please stop this fighting!

00:16:27.660 --> 00:16:28.090
Huh?

00:16:29.830 --> 00:16:30.490
Karin…

00:16:31.330 --> 00:16:35.400
Why are you always doing everything by yourself?

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:37.670
Always… Always!

00:16:37.670 --> 00:16:41.610
Eh? That's the younger prince's line…

00:16:43.170 --> 00:16:44.940
Please give me power as well.

00:16:47.310 --> 00:16:50.310
Err like I said, that's the younger prince's…

00:16:50.310 --> 00:16:52.950
I beg you… please… please…

00:16:52.950 --> 00:16:56.050
PLEASE!!!

00:16:58.490 --> 00:16:59.160
I got it!

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:02.860
I am God!

00:17:34.660 --> 00:17:37.030
Huh? Huh? Karin-chan?

00:17:38.300 --> 00:17:44.770
Oh, the princess has just shined heaven's light on us!

00:17:44.770 --> 00:17:45.740
No way…

00:17:50.480 --> 00:17:52.120
Amazing!

00:17:52.120 --> 00:17:53.200
Great effects!

00:18:00.210 --> 00:18:02.690
Western glasses guy!

00:18:02.690 --> 00:18:03.990
W-Wait a minute!

00:18:03.990 --> 00:18:08.760
God's light, God Thunder!

00:18:14.760 --> 00:18:16.870
Are you trying to fly me too?!

00:18:17.160 --> 00:18:18.700
Sorry!

00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:20.470
I'll take my leave for today.

00:18:20.470 --> 00:18:22.660
But remember what I said!

00:18:27.140 --> 00:18:28.610
Kazune-chan.

00:18:31.410 --> 00:18:33.620
Himeka, are you okay?

00:18:34.320 --> 00:18:35.720
I'm fine.

00:18:36.050 --> 00:18:39.320
Really? It's time for me to go on soon.

00:18:40.790 --> 00:18:44.530
I'll be watching from here.

00:18:45.960 --> 00:18:46.360
Right.

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:51.070
Don't strain yourself, Kazune-kun. You just transformed too-

00:18:51.070 --> 00:18:53.240
I'm fine, I'm fine. It's almost at the end.

00:18:53.500 --> 00:18:54.300
But…

00:18:54.740 --> 00:18:58.040
You came to my rescue, didn't you?

00:18:58.140 --> 00:18:58.700
Huh?

00:18:58.880 --> 00:18:59.980
Right then, I'm up!

00:18:59.980 --> 00:19:03.720
No way! Kazune-kun…

00:19:05.520 --> 00:19:10.020
Why do you always push yourself to the limit?

00:19:11.190 --> 00:19:12.420
All by yourself.

00:19:14.320 --> 00:19:18.660
Please don't collapse, Kazune-kun…

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:26.670
God… God…

00:19:27.670 --> 00:19:29.070
Karin-chan…

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:33.400
This is the last scene.

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:43.370
I told you not to do it.

00:19:43.370 --> 00:19:45.160
Look at what's happened to you.

00:19:46.500 --> 00:19:51.630
But I suppose I always knew that this would come to be.

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:57.760
So long as you still stood, I knew you would fight.

00:19:59.510 --> 00:20:01.400
You push yourself beyond your limits.

00:20:01.400 --> 00:20:03.430
You leave me behind to worry.

00:20:04.960 --> 00:20:06.640
Perhaps you're right about women…

00:20:06.640 --> 00:20:12.620
and how they can only gaze upon the backs of the men you leave their homes for war.

00:20:13.550 --> 00:20:15.690
But despite all that…

00:20:16.590 --> 00:20:19.780
I know I have always loved you…

00:20:19.780 --> 00:20:22.900
completely.

00:20:23.400 --> 00:20:26.000
We'll definitely meet again.

00:20:27.100 --> 00:20:28.000
Princess.

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:33.840
Your feelings… are also mine…

00:20:33.840 --> 00:20:37.800
And if I die in your arms…

00:20:37.870 --> 00:20:40.760
then I am happy.

00:20:47.750 --> 00:20:48.270
Fool.

00:21:11.140 --> 00:21:12.410
Professor Kujyou…

00:21:14.410 --> 00:21:17.810
Why did you give this ring to me?

00:21:37.150 --> 00:21:38.480
Kirika-senpai?

00:21:40.490 --> 00:21:44.010
That girl… she's the one I met during the school festival…

00:21:45.240 --> 00:21:48.040
Then she's the other Himeka-chan?!

00:21:50.080 --> 00:21:55.250
I suppose I've seen the "real" you…

00:21:56.620 --> 00:21:58.050
I think I understand now.

00:21:58.550 --> 00:22:01.960
The "real" me senpai was talking about.

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:05.500
That stuff I said at the end… I meant every word of it.

00:22:06.530 --> 00:22:09.800
I bet Himeka-chan did the same thing.

00:22:10.870 --> 00:22:12.740
She put in her feelings about Kazune-kun.

00:22:17.240 --> 00:22:21.610
But… those words were so fitting.

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:30.220
I feel a little…

00:22:31.450 --> 00:22:33.420
like something bad is about to happen.

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:45.530
Saa, ikou yo shiranai michi

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:45.530
Come, let's go down an unknown path.

00:22:46.320 --> 00:22:53.700
Sugu kieru mayotetteta

00:22:46.320 --> 00:22:53.700
It will soon dissappear, and we'll be lost.

00:22:54.830 --> 00:23:01.540
Hamikaze  sasotte

00:22:54.830 --> 00:23:01.540
Invited by the humming wind…

00:23:01.840 --> 00:23:09.050
Sasayaku kuchi no hou ikutte uta

00:23:01.840 --> 00:23:09.050
…that whispered out of my singing mouth.

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:16.270
Sagashiteta mirai soba ni aru

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:16.270
The future you're looking for is right next to you.

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:23.260
Messeeji wa hitotsu kasanaru yo

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:23.260
The messages are all piling up, one by one.

00:23:24.530 --> 00:23:32.830
Sora e kabatte tobashite yume o kabatte sakebu yo

00:23:24.530 --> 00:23:32.830
I'm going to fly up, protected into the sky and shout my dreams out to the world.

00:23:32.830 --> 00:23:41.380
Kimi ni todoke nanairo no michi tokuchuu meeru

00:23:32.830 --> 00:23:41.380
So that it'll reach you, my special delivery mail along a rainbow-coloured road.

00:23:41.580 --> 00:23:49.380
Hakanai negai demo isshunkai hanatto yo

00:23:41.580 --> 00:23:49.380
I won't abandon my fleeting wish, even for a second.

00:23:49.380 --> 00:24:03.050
Kimi ni todoke kono omoi to kimi ni fuiteta kaze wo

00:23:49.380 --> 00:24:03.050
So that my feelings will reach you, through this blowing wind.

00:24:05.320 --> 00:24:11.670
Micchi, Welcome
